  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/uok5sCT61RDhd1i54L2WJeWG3B8wV9bNXrX6rwyYyysID1xUJkLkJwaPFFmUFyNsetAfCzXbWLKHwMZZjSx5J0MUgpGy68DyM7TQYHvBRlMsWmWcbP6oxnVJf5k4kYAaAGVgE4GXKKuQZvGArqq6HEbDJccLixvNpvAr0aAnBIadtEIqY7ujr5Ey2fdTUdzKaN5CQ1eT\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/25/7034b7fc595fbe4fa31557fe73f920c7..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日はすたばのしんさくのみました</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/bmBH7WugsHTngQaIxF7GWnJm7qzD0PROKQYeHWlpwYOLMb2AIvoOtb54bO9Yssa3f5IzIruRgE5v9KIWjLY6pVoCUMRS5H3S3uExxx8kwpsKZ39hF9blDhmMGQWCR9jFRczXbQBoeKZKqUjQEF2M9qGha6KRoh1K0N1XsgRpoLpTUTqxlOG7WbNeuPOzu6c73zNNP4IM\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/25/4c09b1b52fb495f12b01553316e65dcf..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">クッキーつけたら可愛いですよー！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">って言われたから</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">つけてみたよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/zm6xC3fW2zhkhTd0mPt7WENHnGrqUpdclNAExjX1ElnujREBOuUY8SrMb5fpD2qc0bUTiMUUZAuHedFBGryNR4phWFsxY21iiqhCKtwhP9us00oF19Tfj4CMA2OIVMaNkEVtmtGX9Z2H0RQBEyIJnGtYevKvJbNvnS9THTnzt5ujoPUBL8UaZ3WmXPcwSDfjiBfPSVkd\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/25/37bfe5c85b6b2b1b64638407fdf31ed4..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">すごく、かわいい！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;55円の顔つきだね！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">昨日はVRChatで開催されてる</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">Vket winterを少し巡りました</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/nK6j668dJg3VSYCN2p1RCmxg53O4pr5jfD0IjxzV3XQEY0uwV8dNEgZoZWRzHfh4aq1hs651YDlcHieS7OhN9IjiAYtsdkh5MtrGCMbmcoGKD23enrugTaagrIbg4fxGCzAZcxaxM03pJVnhO97G0muSz43VaNywUE8B25gOYZEo3n1YT6HXu3edhLFMEpXhrwuAD8Gf\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/25/c730cc1182371b2944b295ca742d0911..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">まともに撮った写真が</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">飾られてるやしろあずきさんとの</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">写真だけだった、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/FiGmY4RCHQeS8o5D5nfhViOGaJeb43FcEKTXW9htA04TfhSU4CnqALC0I71VEy2QMXPApvcDcuo3B59YddFLV34ERC7ZT1RTIzvTjPogZltAx4wc0CyOasBBiSBFViI4s58jQcXh4LyL9yRlpXOj8QEQAMPkXfXGwaTfczGZXuP6uY0wxtMqPl455DsG8XEYbpTxcV5S\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/25/ac53c727333fb5bd4336a20e03656ab1..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">これとかもあった</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">楽天カードマン！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">名古屋駅が舞台になってるワールドに行ったんだけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">こんかいも企業ブース面白かったー！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">すぐVR酔いしちゃうから</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">長時間できないのがつらい(p_q*)</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">VR始めたてはちょっと歩くだけでも</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">げろげろになってたよ、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">リハビリしてなんとか長時間できるようになったけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">どんなに頑張っても</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ジェットコースターとかは絶対むりだろうな～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">かなし～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">VR感度がある人もいるし、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">VRって人それぞれで面白い(^_^)</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/dBzSzP3deBLXzeqrt2hQXrpNPErl2EAaLXgXio5DYMdR0swDGYrXKU0OnfeushjnplWOhcufVpoG9WoN60HpgrAJDPGG1rNSlQyKRJE9rmPQ2zhQODeuC2e6Hc0OygYkbAggpsBSoFOVgzS0uQCoOp4wnvKgK1u2ByelqTwrLfAzsemmrgMBsOmW9pllPPegXikH2n51\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/25/7d214c20aaf3322352d65785f747003e..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">名古屋駅の中にラブライブサンシャイン</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">のブースがあってテンション上がったᐢ.  ̫ .ᐢ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/h5YvtV0MfBgekHB7J7MEegN7BfL6XQdQFI8dEzFSMQ9l6ItPDP5OttPHkx873QpcYUrB3RvyTYv6VboZCkdFTWtE3zXtcsTcv0VgD0WCGDmLYme4fQObM2snUAqHQQwLBwvXbw3dkQQQn1DRbtEIpzjwU8rVgBdCjFJCtKjjRapImDWRtJMISYaGKlDfRIUjZBmKtAMw\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/25/6fc9899548f2b585eb0108f9dbf48a8b..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">Vket行くたびに私も3Dモデル作ってみたい！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">って思うけど、人生3周ぐらいしないと</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">無理そう😿</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">終わります</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おやすみ～✌🏻</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
